@startuml
title Pati — Yedekleme, Felaket Kurtarma ve İş Sürekliliği
skinparam shadowing false
node "Primary Region" {
 component "API / Workers" as A1
 database "PostgreSQL Primary" as DB1
 component "Object Storage" as O1
 queue "Queue" as Q1
 component "Secrets / KMS" as K1
}
node "Recovery Region" {
 component "Warm Standby" as A2
 database "Cross-region Replica" as DB2
 component "Replicated Objects" as O2
 queue "Recovery Queue" as Q2
 component "Recovery KMS" as K2
}
cloud "Immutable Backup Vault" as Vault
component "DNS / Traffic Manager" as DNS
component "Synthetic Recovery Tests" as Test
A1 --> DB1
A1 --> O1
A1 --> Q1
DB1 --> DB2 : continuous replication
O1 --> O2 : versioned replication
DB1 --> Vault : encrypted full + WAL/PITR
O1 --> Vault : lifecycle snapshot
K1 ..> K2 : controlled key recovery
DNS --> A1 : normal
DNS ..> A2 : failover
Test --> Vault : restore verification
Test --> A2 : isolated smoke test
note bottom
Hedef sınıfları:
• Rezervasyon / ödeme: RPO ≤ 5 dk, RTO ≤ 30 dk
• Arama / içerik: RPO ≤ 24 saat, RTO ≤ 4 saat
• Audit / ledger: veri kaybı toleransı yok; sağlayıcı mutabakatı ile kurtarma

Üç ayda bir bölgesel tatbikat; aylık örnek restore;
yedek erişimi ayrı rol, silme korumalı ve üretim hesabından izole.
Failover sonrası ödeme/webhook ve queue tekrarları idempotent işlenir.
end note
@enduml
